    "summary": "Your **LEGIONES DAEMONICA SLAANESH** units have **Seductive Gambit**: after such a unit finishes a **Charge move**, you may declare a Seductive Gambit for it. Until the turn ends, a unit that does:\n\n- Loses **[Fights First](vsdata:core-ability/fights-first)**.\n- May re-roll **Hit rolls** for its models' attacks.\n- May re-roll **Wound rolls** of 1 for its models' attacks.",
